namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamDropdown {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown
    src   "A dropdown whose hierarchy is code, not an asset.\n\nThe largest of the preset Blueprints -- sixteen widgets -- reduced to what UUIDropdown actually\nreads: a face with a caption, a list root that Show() positions and animates, and inside it a\ncontent column holding one templated row. The behaviour duplicates that row per option, so the\ntemplate is authored once, inactive, and never drawn itself.\n\nThe row carries the toggle arrangement the library keeps arriving at: hover tints the row's own\nface, the selection mark is a separate visual, because one visual cannot hold two transitions.\n\nOptions are plain texts here rather than the behaviour's text+brush pairs: the common case, and\nthe control's job is to be the common case. A consumer needing per-option icons talks to\nDropdownBehaviour directly.\n\nWhere there is no tween manager to fade the list -- a world with no game instance, which is the\ndesigner's preview and a headless test -- it opens and closes at once, at its end opacity, rather\nthan waiting on a fade that will never run."
    text  "层级由代码而非资源构成的下拉框。\n\n预设蓝图中最庞大的一个——十六个控件——被精简为UUIDropdown实际\n读取的内容：一个带标题的面板，一个由Show()定位并播放动画的列表根节点，其内部是\n一个承载单个模板行的内容列。行为会按每个选项复制该行，因此\n模板只编写一次、处于非活动状态，且自身从不被绘制。\n\n该行采用本库一贯的开关布局：悬停为行自身的\n面板着色，选中标记则是另一个独立视觉元素，因为一个视觉元素无法承载两种过渡。\n\n这里的选项是纯文本，而非行为所用的文本+画刷对：这是常见情形，\n而该控件的职责就是应对常见情形。需要为每个选项提供图标的调用方请直接与\nDropdownBehaviour交互。\n\n在没有补间管理器可用于淡化列表时——即没有游戏实例的世界，也就是\n设计器预览和无头测试——它会立即以最终不透明度打开和关闭，而不是\n等待一段永远不会运行的淡化。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:AddOption {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:AddOption
    src   "The option list, one call at a time -- UMG's combo box API, which is what a screen building its\noptions from game data actually uses.\n\nEvery one of them re-pushes, because the rows the player sees are BUILT from this array: an\noption added without a push is data the open list has never heard of. FText rather than FString\nthroughout, because an option is something a player reads and this framework localizes text by\ncarrying FText all the way rather than by converting at the end."
    text  "选项列表，一次调用处理一个——UMG组合框的API，也正是从游戏数据构建选项的\n界面实际使用的接口。\n\n它们每一个都会重新推送，因为玩家看到的行是由这个数组构建出来的：添加\n选项而不推送，该数据对已打开的列表来说就是从未存在过的。全程使用FText而非FString，\n因为选项是玩家要阅读的内容，而本框架的本地化方式是自始至终传递FText，\n而不是在最后再做转换。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:bHasDownArrow {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:bHasDownArrow
    src   "Whether the face draws its own arrow glyph -- UMG's HasDownArrow. Off is for a face that says\n\"open me\" some other way (an icon of its own, a border)."
    text  "面板是否绘制自己的箭头字形——即UMG的HasDownArrow。关闭适用于以其他方式表达“打开我”的\n面板（自带的图标、边框）。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:bTabCommitsHighlightedRow {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:bTabCommitsHighlightedRow
    src   "Tab or Shift+Tab in the open list chooses the row the player is on, then the list closes and the Tab moves on past\nthe dropdown -- what an HTML select does. Off, Tab only closes the list and chooses nothing. Tab never walks the rows:\nthe arrow keys and the pad do that."
    text  "在打开的列表中按Tab或Shift+Tab会选择玩家当前所在的行，随后列表关闭，Tab继续越过\n下拉框向前移动——这正是HTML select的行为。关闭时，Tab只会关闭列表，不选择任何内容。Tab从不逐行移动：\n那是方向键和手柄的工作。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:ClearOptions {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:ClearOptions
    src   "The options and their icons, both. The selection is ClearSelection's business, not this one's."
