DreamDropdown:IsOpen {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:IsOpen
    src   "Whether the list is up. Mirrored from the behaviour's own visibility seam rather than kept by\nwhoever opened it, so a list closed by a click elsewhere is not still \"open\" here."
    text  "列表是否展开。镜像自行为自身的可见性接口，而非由\n打开它的一方保存，因此被别处点击关闭的列表在这里不会仍为“展开”。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:ItemTemplateClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:ItemTemplateClass
    src   "An option row's CONTENT, authored elsewhere: one instance of this class is created inside\nevery item widget, filling it, and the built-in label steps aside. The row's face, its check\nmark, its hover and its selection stay the control's, so a template only has to draw an option.\n\nMade per ITEM rather than pooled, because a dropdown rebuilds its list on every open rather\nthan recycling rows; OnItemGenerated fires alongside, and is where a consumer fills it.\n\nNull (the default) is the built-in label row. Instancing a user widget needs a world, so with\nnone this quietly stays the built-in row rather than producing half a list. Exactly the bargain\nUDreamListViewBase::RowTemplateClass makes, in the same words."
    text  "选项行的内容，由别处编写：每个项控件内部都会创建该类的一个实例来\n填充它，内置标签则让位。行的外观、对勾、\n悬停与选中状态仍归控件所有，因此模板只需绘制一个选项。\n\n按项创建而非池化，因为下拉框每次打开都会重建列表，而不是\n复用行；OnItemGenerated同时触发，使用者在此填充。\n\nNull（默认值）即内置标签行。实例化用户控件需要一个world，所以\n没有world时会安静地保留内置行，而不是产出半个列表。与\nUDreamListViewBase::RowTemplateClass的取舍完全一致，措辞也相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:MaxVisibleItems {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:MaxVisibleItems
    src   "How many rows the open list shows at most. The list is always exactly as tall as its visible\nrows -- rows-times-row-height, no more -- and past this many the rest scroll: the cap is a\ncount because that is how a designer thinks about a dropdown, not in pixels."
    text  "展开的列表最多显示多少行。列表高度始终恰好等于其可见\n行——行数乘以行高，不多一分——超过该数量后其余部分滚动：上限用行数\n表示，因为设计师就是这样考虑下拉框的，而不是用像素。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:OnClosed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:OnClosed
    src   "The list closed, whether by a choice or by a click elsewhere."
    text  "列表已关闭，无论是通过选择还是通过点击别处。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:OnItemGenerated {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:OnItemGenerated
    src   "One per option row, as the list is built. The hook for a consumer whose options are richer\nthan a word but who would rather not author a whole class: everything under the row is\nreachable from here by display name. The dropdown's counterpart of the list's OnRowGenerated."
    text  "列表构建时每个选项行触发一次。面向这样的使用者：选项比一个词更丰富\n但又不愿编写整个类——行下的所有内容都可从此处按显示名称\n访问。相当于列表的 OnRowGenerated 在下拉框中的对应物。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:OnOpening {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:OnOpening
    src   "The list is opening -- UMG's OnOpening, and the moment to refresh the options from.\n\nFired from the behaviour's Show, which is the moment the list appears: its rows are already built\nthen, and options written from a handler here rebuild them at once, before the list is sized and\nplaced -- so they are the ones the player sees."
    text  "列表正在打开——即 UMG 的 OnOpening，也是刷新选项的时机。\n\n由行为的 Show 触发，那正是列表出现的时刻：此时其行已构建完成，\n从此处的处理程序写入的选项会立即重建它们，且在列表完成尺寸计算与\n放置之前——因此玩家看到的就是这些选项。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:OnSelectionChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:OnSelectionChanged
    src   "Re-broadcast from the behaviour, so a consumer binds to the control, not to a part of it."
    text  "从行为转发而来，因此使用方绑定的是控件本身，而不是它的某个部件。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:OnValueChangedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:OnValueChangedBP
    src   "The `<->` convention: two-way bindings synthesize their reverse route against this exact\nname, so a value control carries it alongside its spoken events. Fires with them."
    text  "`<->` 约定：双向绑定会针对这个确切的\n名称合成其反向路由，因此值控件会连同它一起携带自身事件。与它们一同触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:OptionIcons {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:OptionIcons
    src   "A picture per option, index-matched to Options -- the same parallel-array idiom TabLabels and\nTabEnabled use, and for the same reason: a struct per option would make the common case (no\nicons at all) cost an array literal the language cannot write.\n\nA sprite or a texture, by the rule every face in this library follows. A missing or null entry\nis no icon, so a short list is an ordinary state."
    text  "每个选项一张图片，与 Options 按下标对应——与 TabLabels 和\nTabEnabled 使用相同的平行数组惯例，原因也相同：每个选项一个结构体会让\n常见情形（完全没有图标）付出该语言写不出的数组字面量代价。\n\n精灵或纹理，遵循本库中每个外观都遵循的规则。缺失或为 null 的条目\n即没有图标，因此较短的列表是正常状态。"
    state machine
}

DreamDropdown:Options {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamDropdown.h#DreamDropdown:Options
    src   "BlueprintReadOnly rather than a BlueprintSetter pair, and for the reason UDreamDialog::Buttons\nis: the options are what the open list is BUILT from, so a Blueprint writing this array in\nplace changed the data and left the list showing the old copy. SetOptions is the way in. The\ndesigner and .dui still author it directly, where PostEditChangeProperty re-pushes."
    text  "用 BlueprintReadOnly 而不是一对 BlueprintSetter，原因与 UDreamDialog::Buttons\n相同：选项是展开列表构建所依据的数据，因此蓝图就地写入此数组只会\n改动数据，让列表仍显示旧副本。SetOptions 才是正规入口。\n设计器和 .dui 仍可直接编写它，此时 PostEditChangeProperty 会重新推送。"
    state machine
}

